# Ignore in all directories
**/.DS_Store
**/node_modules
**/prompts_master.md

# other dependencies
**/.pnp
**.pnp.js

# testing
**/coverage

# production
**/build
**/dist

# logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# IDE
.idea
.vscode

# .env
.mcp.json

# Claude Code per-user settings
**/.claude/settings.json
**/.claude/settings.local.json

# temp files
**/tmp

# git worktrees
.worktrees/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secretos y credenciales — NUNCA versionar (ver docs/n8n-aws-standards.md §3)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Variables de entorno (se versiona solo .env.example)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
# Llaves SSH / certificados
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.ppk
id_rsa*
# Credenciales AWS / nube
**/.aws/
**/aws-credentials*
**/*credentials*.json
!**/credentials.example.json
# Tokens y secretos de n8n / Grafana / OpenAI
**/n8n-secrets*
**/grafana-token*
**/*.secret
# Workflows n8n exportados CON credenciales (solo se versionan los limpios en n8n/workflows/)
**/*.with-credentials.json
